                      1,000,000, and for thirty (30) days after the close of the
                      first fiscal year in which it is not. Any other production
                      use of the Licensed Work by, for, or on behalf of a person
                      or entity whose Qualifying Revenue is EUR 1,000,000 or more
                      requires a separate commercial license from the Licensor
                      (licensing@creativemayhem.com).

                      "Qualifying Revenue" means the total gross revenue, from
                      all sources, of the user together with all of its
                      Affiliates, for the most recently completed fiscal year
                      or, if the user has no completed fiscal year, the trailing
                      twelve months. It is counted in the aggregate across all
                      Affiliates and is not divided, allocated, or measured per
                      artist, act, release, catalog, project, or individual
                      entity. Amounts reported in other currencies are converted
                      at the euro foreign exchange reference rate published by
                      the European Central Bank for the last day of the relevant
                      period.

                      "Affiliate" means any person or entity that, directly or
                      indirectly, controls, is controlled by, or is under common
                      control with the user. "Control" means (a) ownership of
                      more than fifty percent (50%) of the voting equity or
                      economic interest of an entity, or (b) the power to direct
                      or cause the direction of its management or policies,
                      whether through ownership, contract, or otherwise.
                      Affiliates include parent entities, subsidiaries, and
                      entities that share a common parent.

                      Where an artist, act, label, imprint, catalog, release,
                      project, brand, or other entity is an Affiliate of, or is
                      controlled by, financed by, distributed by, or operated
                      for the benefit of, a person or entity whose Qualifying
                      Revenue is EUR 1,000,000 or more, use of the Licensed Work
                      in connection with it requires a commercial license,
                      regardless of its standalone revenue. The threshold is
                      measured at the level of the ultimate controlling person
                      or entity and may not be reduced or avoided by separating,
                      assigning, sub-licensing, or housing the use within a
                      lower-revenue Affiliate.

